/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:99:Key insight: Wall barriers restrict connectivity — only maroon pixels reachable via flood-fill through the floor qualify, so proximity alone isn't enough.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:100:</description>
