/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:298:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:299:Slide black shapes rightward to a grey separator, then shoot red rays from enclosed holes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:300:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:301:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:302:- A vertical grey (5) separator column divides the grid into left and right halves.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:303:- Black shapes sit on the left side against a background color (bg).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:304:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:305:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:306:- Translate each black connected component rightward until its right edge is flush with the separator.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:307:- After sliding, find enclosed bg regions (holes) within the black shapes that touch the column just left of the separator.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:308:- For each row spanned by such a hole, emit a red ray across the entire right half of the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:309:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:310:Key insight: Only holes adjacent to the separator trigger rays — the sliding creates enclosures that act as "nozzles" projecting rightward.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:311:</description>
