/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:323:- Erase each sprite from the left and stamp it centered at every target. Higher sprites cover lower ones.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:324:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:325:Key insight: One sprite replicates to a grid of row × column marker intersections.
