/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:349:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:350:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:351:- Background (bg) fills most of the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:352:- Top-left corner: a small square legend region bordered on its bottom and right edges by a single color; the interior holds a set of "target" colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:353:- Elsewhere: multicolored objects (4-connected components) on the bg.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:354:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:355:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:356:- Read the target color set from inside the legend border.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:357:- For each connected component, check whether it contains **all** target colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:358:- Erase (fill with bg) every component that does; leave all others unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:359:- Output grid is the same size.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:360:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/prompt.md:361:Key insight: The legend acts as a filter specification — only components carrying the full color palette shown in the legend are removed.
