/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:137:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:138:- The background is the most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:139:- One large monochrome foreground object is the mask; its bbox is the output region and may contain background holes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:140:- The remaining foreground is a 3-row palette rectangle with the same width as the mask bbox: two identical color rows and one uniform row.
