/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:144:- For each output column, color mask pixels with the corresponding color from the repeated palette rows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:145:- Replace background holes inside the crop with the palette's uniform third-row color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:146:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:147:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:148:The grey object is only a stencil; its columns select colors from the legend, while its holes expose the legend's fill color.
