/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:226:Summarize the enclosed table slots by the single object color inside each slot, using the slot background color for empty slots.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:227:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:228:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:229:- The most common color forms the outer background and all enclosed slot
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:230:  backgrounds.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:231:- The enclosed background components form a complete rectangular array of
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:232:  slots, ordered by their positions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:233:- Each slot contains either no other color or exactly one object color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:234:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:235:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:236:- Find all 4-connected components of the most common color that do not touch
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:237:  the input edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:238:- Sort their bounding boxes into row and column order to define the output
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:239:  table.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:240:- For each slot, output its unique non-background color if present; otherwise
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:241:  output the background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:242:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:243:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:244:- The large grid is an expanded table: the enclosed background components are
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:245:  the cells, and any colored object drawn inside a cell is that cell's summary
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:246:  value.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:247:</description>
