/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:310:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:311:- A one-cell-thick rectangular frame has four solid-colored sides and neutral corner pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:312:- The frame interior contains a dominant background color and one foreground object color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:313:- Some object boundaries contain five-pixel plus-shaped background notches.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:314:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:315:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:316:- Find every background plus whose opposite side is supported by foreground object pixels and whose open side faces one frame side.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:317:- Recolor the five pixels of that plus with the color of the facing frame side.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:318:- Leave all other pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:319:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:320:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:321:The frame side colors are direction labels for the open notches in the foreground object.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/3.md:322:</description>
