/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:172:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:173:- A dominant background contains one full-width or full-height one-pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:174:  separator line in a non-background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:175:- One other foreground color forms solid rectangular objects, all strictly on the same side of that separator.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:176:- Remaining non-background pixels are scattered distractors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:177:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:178:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:179:- Keep the input grid shape and unchanged pixels outside each affected corridor.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:180:- Mirror each source object across the separator line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:181:- For every source object, recolor the rectangular strip between the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:182:  original object and its reflection to the separator color, then paint the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:183:  reflected object in the source color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:184:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:185:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:186:- The full straight line is a mirror axis; the real objects are identified
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:187:  structurally as the only solid rectangles confined to one side, while
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:188:  scattered pixels are noise that may be overwritten inside the corridor.
