/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:286:Move each gray bar into its adjacent orange rectangle as full stripes from the contacted edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:287:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:288:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:289:- The scene uses black outside space, yellow fill, gray one-cell-thick bars, and solid orange rectangles.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:290:- Each gray bar 4-touches exactly one orange rectangle; some orange rectangles have no touching gray bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:291:- Gray bars touching the same orange rectangle all have the same orientation.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:292:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:293:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:294:- Recolor every original gray cell to yellow.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:295:- For each orange rectangle touched by gray bars, count the gray cells assigned to that rectangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:296:- Horizontal gray bars repaint that many cells as complete orange rows starting from the contacted top or bottom row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:297:- Vertical gray bars repaint that many cells as complete orange columns starting from the contacted left or right column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:298:- Orange rectangles with no touching gray bar remain unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:299:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:300:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:301:- The gray pixels are not copied by shape; their count is transferred into the neighboring orange rectangle as edge-aligned row or column stripes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:302:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/2.md:303:<annotation>
