/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:93:Drop the singleton marker into the matching red U-shaped container, or make a bottom-row puddle if no closed container is hit.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:94:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:95:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:96:- The grid has a dominant background, one singleton marker pixel on the top row,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:97:  and one other foreground color forming vertical bars and bottom segments.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:98:- A closed container is a U shape: two vertical side bars with a continuous
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:99:  bottom segment between them and an empty rectangular interior above the bottom.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:100:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:101:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:102:- Remove the top marker from its original cell.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:103:- If exactly one closed U-shaped container has the marker column within its
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:104:  horizontal footprint, fill that container's empty interior with the marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:105:- If no closed container is under the marker column, fill the whole bottom row
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:106:  with the marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:107:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:108:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:109:- The marker does not identify a color by value; it identifies a vertical drop
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:110:  column, and only a structurally closed U shape can catch and contain the fill.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:111:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:112:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:113:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:114:  "type": "move_along_path",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:115:  "src": "singleton top-row marker pixel",
