/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:137:Move each marker from a lattice corner gap into the adjacent enclosed 12-pixel cavity.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:138:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:139:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:140:- The grid is a repeated teal lattice around black 12-pixel cavities.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:141:- A marker is a non-black pixel placed at the northwest corner gap of one
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:142:  complete 5x5 lattice tile; the marker may itself be teal.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:143:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:144:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:145:- For every marked northwest corner gap, clear that marker to black.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:146:- Fill the 12 black pixels in the tile immediately down-right of the marker
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:147:  with the marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:148:- Leave the rest of the lattice unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:149:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:150:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:151:- The apparent isolated markers are control pixels for the adjacent cavity;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:152:  teal markers are recognized as extra teal pixels occupying a gap that the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:153:  periodic lattice template says should be black.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:154:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:155:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:156:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:157:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:158:  "src": "non-black marker pixels at northwest corner gaps of 5x5 teal lattice tiles",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:159:  "transform": "erase each marker; fill the 12 black pixels in the adjacent down-right cavity with marker color",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:160:  "notes": "a teal marker is an extra teal pixel in a gap that the lattice template otherwise leaves black"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:161:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:162:</annotation>
