/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:178:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:179:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:180:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:181:- bg = most common color; yellow pixels sit inside enclosed regions bounded by colored walls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:182:- Border legends: small rectangles on the grid edge whose fill color C matches a region's border color. Each legend contains a center dot and an indicator dot encoding a direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:183:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:184:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:185:- For each enclosed region, identify its border color C and look up the legend with fill color C.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:186:- The direction from the legend's center dot to its indicator dot gives the slide direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:187:- All yellow pixels in that region slide in that direction, stacking against the far wall.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:188:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:189:Key insight: Legend fill color links to region border color; the center→indicator offset encodes the movement vector.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:190:</description>
