/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:227:Recolor the sparse foreground pixels in scan order along their longer spread, cycling red, teal, and grey.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:228:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:229:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:230:- The dominant color is the background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:231:- Every foreground object is a single isolated 4-connected pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:232:- The foreground pixel set has a rectangular bbox whose row or column extent defines the scan direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:233:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:234:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:235:- Keep the background unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:236:- If the foreground bbox is at least as tall as it is wide, order foreground pixels row-major; otherwise order them column-major.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:237:- Recolor the ordered pixels by repeating red, teal, grey from the first pixel onward.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:238:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:239:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:240:- The original foreground colors are only markers; the output color depends on each marker's ordinal position in the dominant scan direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:241:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:242:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:243:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:244:  "type": "move_in_order",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:245:  "src": "isolated foreground marker pixels on the background",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:246:  "dst": "same marker locations",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:247:  "transform": "ignore the original marker colors and recolor the ordered markers by repeating red, teal, grey",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:248:  "multi_step": "scan row-major when the foreground bbox is at least as tall as wide; otherwise scan column-major"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:249:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:250:</annotation>
