/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:266:Assemble scattered rectangular pieces into a rectangle at an L-marker corner.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:267:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:268:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:269:- bg = most common color. Non-bg rectangular pieces scattered on the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:270:- 3-pixel L-marker (2x2 minus one cell) tags the corner; the gap is the corner cell.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:271:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:272:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:273:- rect_col = most common color across all piece pixels; all outer rectangle edges must be rect_col.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:274:- Translate pieces (no rotation) to tile the rectangle; touching edges must match, with rect_col as wildcard.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:275:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:276:Key insight: rect_col acts as wildcard during edge matching — only non-rect_col pixels at shared boundaries must agree.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:277:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:278:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:279:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:280:  "type": "move_to_match",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:281:  "src": "unfitted sprite s",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:282:  "dst": "fit against the matching edge d of a jigsaw growing from a corner square tagged by a marker",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:283:  "match_cond": "s.edge.colors == d.colors, i.e. pixels with same postion on edge have same color",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:284:  "multi_step": "attach pieces one onto another",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:285:  "notes": "hidden rules: 1) the final jigsaw must be a rectangle with two edges established by the tagger corner; 2) the edges of the final rectangle must **all** be the same color, which is the \"backgroud\" color of the final rectangle."
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:286:}
