/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:305:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:306:- bg background; rectangular frame on right with colored markers on its edges; sprites in a narrow left strip separated by a constant-color divider column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:307:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:308:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:309:- For each color, target rows/cols are where both opposite frame edges share that color. Targets are the Cartesian product.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:310:- Erase each sprite from the left and stamp it centered at every target. Higher sprites cover lower ones.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:311:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:312:Key insight: One sprite replicates to a grid of row × column marker intersections.
