/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:338:Repeat each 3x3 control-center sprite toward the matching solid rectangle until a copy first overlaps that rectangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:339:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:340:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:341:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:342:- Each sprite is a 3x3 foreground object whose eight border pixels have one color and whose center has a different control color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:343:- For every control color, there is exactly one separate solid rectangular object of that color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:344:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:345:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:346:- Match each sprite to the unique solid rectangle whose color equals the sprite center.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:347:- Copy the whole 3x3 sprite in the cardinal direction of that rectangle, stepping by three cells each time.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:348:- Stop after pasting the first copy whose 3x3 bbox overlaps the rectangle; copied pixels overwrite the rectangle there.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:349:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:350:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:351:The center pixel is not the paint color: it is a destination key, while the entire 3x3 sprite is the motif tiled along the straight path.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:352:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:353:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:354:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:355:  "type": "move_along_path",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:356:  "src": "3x3 sprite s with a uniform border color and a different control-color center",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:357:  "path": "straight cardinal path from s toward d",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:358:  "trajectory": "copy s every three cells until the first copied bbox overlaps d",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:359:  "dst": "separate solid rectangle d whose color matches s.center",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:360:  "transform": "copied sprites overwrite background/rectangle cells; all other input pixels remain unchanged"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:361:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/7.md:362:</annotation>
