/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:96:Fill enclosed regions along a line seeded by unique border pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:97:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:98:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:99:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:100:- Colored lines/drawings on the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:101:- Unique single-pixel colors on the grid border mark seed endpoints of each line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:102:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:103:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:104:- Each border seed pixel connects (8-connected) to a line drawing.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:105:- Find closed bg cavities whose boundary touches that line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:106:- Flood-fill each such cavity with the seed pixel's color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:107:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:108:Key insight: Only cavities reachable through the seed's own line get filled; the seed's unique color acts as a per-line fill label.
