/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:146:Fill hollow sprites' interiors using a color-palette legend on the grid edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:147:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:148:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:149:- bg = most common color. Several hollow sprites with distinct border colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:150:- A small 2×N or N×2 palette block sits on one grid edge; one row/column lists border colors, the other lists corresponding fill colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:151:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:152:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:153:- Locate the palette legend on a grid edge and read it as a border→fill color mapping.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:154:- Find enclosed bg regions (holes) inside sprites that don't touch the grid boundary.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:155:- For each hole, identify the most common adjacent border color, look it up in the palette, and fill the hole with the mapped fill color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:156:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:157:Key insight: The palette's edge position and orientation determine reading direction; border colors in the palette uniquely key into fill colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:158:</description>
