/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:195:Replace the outlined object with the outside contour of that outline in the marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:196:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:197:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:198:- A dominant background surrounds one 8-connected foreground outline.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:199:- The outline is the unique largest foreground color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:200:- One or more smaller interior colors are inside the outline; the marker color
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:201:  is the unique smallest non-outline color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:202:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:203:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:204:- Erase all original foreground pixels to background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:205:- Paint every background pixel that is 4-adjacent to the outline with the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:206:  marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:207:- Keep the grid shape unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:208:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:209:Key insight: The colored interior marker supplies the paint color, while the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:210:largest outline supplies only the contour whose outside edge is traced.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:211:</description>
