/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:234:Slide a solid square through a winding channel to reach a same-sized target square.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:235:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:236:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:237:- bg (most common color). A river color forms a winding corridor.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:238:- Two same-sized NxN solid squares on the river: mover and destination, each a distinct color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:239:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:240:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:241:- The mover square travels along the river toward the destination.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:242:- It can only pass through positions where the full NxN area is river.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:243:- If reachable, the mover replaces the destination; otherwise it stops at the farthest reachable point.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:244:- The mover's original position is filled with the river color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:245:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:246:Key insight: Chokepoints narrower than N pixels block the square, forcing it to stop short.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:247:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:248:<annotation>
