/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:276:- Colored legend shapes (non-bg, non-grey, at least 2×2, not touching the outer border) near grid edge,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:277:  each with a distinct number of enclosed holes.
