/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:279:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:280:- Each colored legend shape defines a mapping: hole count → color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:281:- For every grey sprite, count its holes (enclosed bg regions not touching the sprite's bounding-box border).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:282:- Recolor the grey sprite to the matching legend color; erase grey distractors with unlisted hole counts.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:283:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:284:Key insight: Shape identity is encoded by topology (number of holes), not geometry or size.
