/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:321:Rotate each vertical bar's color one slot right and its height one slot left.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:322:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:323:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:324:- A dominant background surrounds several monochrome one-cell-wide vertical bars.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:325:- Every bar is bottom-aligned and occupies a distinct column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:326:- The ordered bar slots are read from left to right.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:327:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:328:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:329:- Keep the grid shape and the bar columns unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:330:- At slot i, use the color from the previous slot cyclically.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:331:- At slot i, use the height from the next slot cyclically.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:332:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:333:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:334:- Color and height are independent cyclic attributes of the ordered bar slots:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:335:  colors rotate right while heights rotate left.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:336:</description>
