/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:359:Slide multi-color sprites to align their marker pixels with matching isolated border anchors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:360:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:361:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:362:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:363:- Multi-color sprites in the interior; each has a minority-color "marker" pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:364:- Isolated border pixels (non-bg with all 4-neighbors bg) act as anchors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:365:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:366:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:367:- Match each sprite to the border anchor sharing its marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:368:- Top/bottom-edge anchor (non-corner): slide sprite horizontally so marker column = anchor column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:369:- Left/right-edge anchor (or corner): slide sprite vertically so marker row = anchor row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:370:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/5.md:371:Key insight: The anchor's edge position determines the slide axis — top/bottom means horizontal, left/right (or corner) means vertical.
