/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:49:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:50:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:51:The grid has one background color and one foreground color; the foreground forms
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:52:separate solid rectangles, ordered from left to right.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:53:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:54:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:55:Build a 10-row background canvas whose width is the packed width of the wide
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:56:versions of the rectangles. For each source rectangle, paint a top-aligned
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:57:rectangle of shape min(h,w) by max(h,w), with one background column between
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:58:consecutive rectangles. Then, starting again from the left edge, paint a
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:59:bottom-aligned rectangle of shape max(h,w) by min(h,w) for each source rectangle,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:60:again separated by one background column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:61:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:62:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:63:The input rectangles are not copied in their original orientations; each object
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:64:contributes one horizontal-facing and one vertical-facing normalized rectangle,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:65:preserving left-to-right object order.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:66:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:67:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:68:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:69:  "type": "move_in_order",
