/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:72:  "match_cond": "rank(s) == rank(d) for both the upper and lower slot sequences",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:73:  "transform": "paint each rectangle twice: min(h,w) by max(h,w) top-aligned in the upper band, and max(h,w) by min(h,w) bottom-aligned in the lower band, with one background column between slots",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:74:  "grid_shape": "height 10; width is the sum of max(h,w) over source rectangles plus one separator column between consecutive rectangles"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:75:}
