/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:92:Reflect the solid rectangular source objects across the full separator line and color the gap with the separator color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:93:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:94:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:95:- A dominant background contains one full-width or full-height one-pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:96:  separator line in a non-background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:97:- One other foreground color forms solid rectangular objects, all strictly on the same side of that separator.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:98:- Remaining non-background pixels are scattered distractors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:99:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:100:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:101:- Keep the input grid shape and unchanged pixels outside each affected corridor.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:102:- Mirror each source object across the separator line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:103:- For every source object, recolor the rectangular strip between the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:104:  original object and its reflection to the separator color, then paint the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:105:  reflected object in the source color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:106:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:107:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:108:- The full straight line is a mirror axis; the real objects are identified
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:109:  structurally as the only solid rectangles confined to one side, while
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:110:  scattered pixels are noise that may be overwritten inside the corridor.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:111:</description>
