/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:117:  "transform": "copy each source object by reflection; recolor the rectangular strip between each source object and its mirror to the separator color, overwriting background or distractor pixels inside that strip"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:118:}
