/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:154:  "dst": "next panel in the sequence",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:155:  "transform": "use the template panel as the output canvas; for each dynamic color absent from the template, follow its regular panel schedule and extrapolate the last two interval changes one more step along the changing row or column axis",
