/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:176:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:177:- Full same-color separator rows and columns partition the grid into equal rectangular tiles.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:178:- One tile contains the only non-background, non-separator colored sprite.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:179:- Target tiles are otherwise background-colored but contain at least one internal pixel of the separator color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:180:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:181:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:182:- Keep the separator lines and the source sprite tile unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:183:- Replace each marked target tile with an exact copy of the source tile.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:184:- Unmarked background-only tiles remain unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:185:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:186:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:187:- The internal separator-colored pixels are placement markers; the single colored tile is the template to stamp into those marked cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:188:</description>
