/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:252:Keep the largest 8-connected motif and replace the corner/control pixels with a solid corner triangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:253:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:254:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:255:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:256:- Exactly one grid corner contains a foreground control pixel; it gives the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:257:  corner from which the triangle is painted.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:258:- There is one unique largest 8-connected monochrome foreground object, the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:259:  motif that remains in the output; all other foreground pixels are controls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:260:- Every foreground component outside that motif is a singleton control pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:261:- The fill color is the unique control color that appears in at least two
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:262:  non-corner control pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:263:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:264:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:265:- Start from a blank background canvas and redraw only the largest motif.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:266:- Count the non-corner control pixels; that count is the triangle side.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:267:- Paint the fill color on the right-triangle region where those two distances
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:268:  from the marked corner's edges sum to less than the side length.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:269:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:270:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:271:- The scattered singleton controls are counted into a compact triangular
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:272:  stack at the marked corner; only the largest motif is not part of the count.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:273:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:274:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:275:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:276:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:277:  "src": "largest 8-connected monochrome foreground object plus singleton control pixels, one in a grid corner",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:278:  "transform": "keep only the largest object; count non-corner controls as triangle side; fill the marked corner with a solid right triangle in the unique control color that appears at least twice",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:279:  "notes": "singleton controls sharing the motif color are still counted; only the largest component is preserved"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:280:}
