/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:297:Extract the hidden two-color image by compacting the rows and columns of its complete mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:298:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:299:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:300:The grid contains one pair of colors whose pixels occupy every cell in the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:301:cross product of their active rows and active columns; all other colors form
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:302:the surrounding filler or separators.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:303:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:304:Find that unique color pair, keep exactly the rows and columns touched by
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:305:the pair, and return the induced subgrid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:306:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:307:The target image is not chosen by color id; it is the only two-color mask
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:308:whose occupied pixels form a full rectangular row/column product after
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:309:deleting unused rows and columns.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:310:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:311:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:312:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:313:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:314:  "src": "unique two-color mask whose pixels fill the cross product of its active rows and active columns",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:315:  "transform": "delete every row and column not touched by that mask, preserving the induced two-color subgrid",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:316:  "grid_shape": "active mask rows x active mask columns"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:317:}
