/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:334:Push the central solid rectangle to the grid edge, splitting the perpendicular target rectangle around its path.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:335:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:336:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:337:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:338:- There are exactly three monochrome foreground objects arranged on one
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:339:  horizontal or vertical axis.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:340:- The middle object on that axis is a solid rectangular moving object.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:341:- One end object is a solid rectangle or bar whose long side is perpendicular
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:342:  to the movement axis; this is the target to split.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:343:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:344:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:345:- Move the middle rectangle along the axis toward the target until it is
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:346:  flush with the grid edge in that direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:347:- Clear the original middle rectangle and the original target.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:348:- Split the target through the moving rectangle's two-cell-wide path and
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:349:  shift the two halves one cell outward perpendicular to the movement.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:350:- Keep the other end object unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:351:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:352:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:353:- The non-target end object acts as a pusher; the central rectangle travels
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:354:  away from it through the perpendicular target, opening a matching gap.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:355:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:356:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:357:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:358:  "type": "move_along_path",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:359:  "src": "middle solid rectangular object between two end objects",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:360:  "path": "straight horizontal or vertical line away from the non-target end object and through the perpendicular solid target rectangle/bar",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:361:  "dst": "place flush with the grid edge beyond the target",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:362:  "trajectory": "paint only the final moved rectangle at dst",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:363:  "transform": "erase original source pixels; split the target rectangle/bar along the moving object's two-cell-wide path and shift its two halves one cell outward perpendicular to the movement; keep the other end object unchanged"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:364:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/6.md:365:</annotation>
