/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:48:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:49:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:50:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:51:- bg = most common color; yellow pixels sit inside enclosed regions bounded by colored walls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:52:- Border legends: small rectangles on the grid edge whose fill color C matches a region's border color. Each legend contains a center dot and an indicator dot encoding a direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:53:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:54:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:55:- For each enclosed region, identify its border color C and look up the legend with fill color C.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:56:- The direction from the legend's center dot to its indicator dot gives the slide direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:57:- All yellow pixels in that region slide in that direction, stacking against the far wall.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:58:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:59:Key insight: Legend fill color links to region border color; the center→indicator offset encodes the movement vector.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:60:</description>
