/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:97:Move the small colored sprite into the hollow frame by stretching its shape to the frame interior.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:98:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:99:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:100:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:101:- There are exactly two foreground colors: one forms a complete rectangular
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:102:  one-pixel-thick frame, and the other forms one 4-connected sprite outside it.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:103:- The frame interior is initially background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:104:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:105:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:106:- Clear the original sprite from its outside location.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:107:- Map the sprite bbox to the frame interior bbox, sending bbox extremes to
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:108:  interior extremes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:109:- Draw straight horizontal or vertical segments between mapped positions of
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:110:  adjacent sprite pixels, then fill any enclosed background region inside
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:111:  those drawn segments.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:112:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:113:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:114:The outside sprite is a miniature line/fill diagram for the frame interior,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:115:not a bitmap to scale by block replication.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:116:</description>
