/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:141:Predict the next panel in a framed sequence by continuing each scheduled colored interval.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:142:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:143:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:144:- The grid is made from three or more equal panels in one row or one column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:145:- The final input panel is the static target template; every earlier panel differs from it only by dynamic colors absent from the template.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:146:- Each dynamic color appears in a regular temporal schedule across the earlier panels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:147:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:148:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:149:- Keep the final template panel as the output canvas.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:150:- For every dynamic color whose schedule reaches the next panel, compare its last two appearances.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:151:- Extrapolate each one-dimensional interval along the color's changing row or column axis and paint that predicted mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:152:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:153:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:154:- The task is not asking for the last visible panel, but for the next frame after the blank/template slot.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:155:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:156:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:157:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:158:  "type": "symmetry/pattern",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:159:  "src": "sequence of equal rectangular panels ending with a blank/static template panel",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:160:  "dst": "next panel in the sequence",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:161:  "transform": "use the template panel as the output canvas; for each dynamic color absent from the template, follow its regular panel schedule and extrapolate the last two interval changes one more step along the changing row or column axis",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:162:  "grid_shape": "same shape as one panel"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:163:}
