/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:181:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:182:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:183:- bg background, a rectangular single-color frame, colored placeholder cells inside the frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:184:- Outside the frame: sprite shapes (one per placeholder color) and a small legend mapping each placeholder color to an output color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:185:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:186:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:187:- Find the frame and its interior placeholders.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:188:- For each placeholder color, locate the matching-color sprite outside the frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:189:- Stamp each sprite at the placeholder's position inside the frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:190:- Recolor every stamped sprite to the output color defined by the legend.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:191:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:192:Key insight: The legend pairs (overlapping two-color glyphs outside the frame) dictate the final recoloring — placeholder color selects the shape, legend maps it to the output color.
