/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:329:Copy the unique colored sprite tile into every tiled cell marked by an internal separator-colored pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:330:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:331:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:332:- Full same-color separator rows and columns partition the grid into equal rectangular tiles.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:333:- One tile contains the only non-background, non-separator colored sprite.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:334:- Target tiles are otherwise background-colored but contain at least one internal pixel of the separator color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:335:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:336:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:337:- Keep the separator lines and the source sprite tile unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:338:- Replace each marked target tile with an exact copy of the source tile.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:339:- Unmarked background-only tiles remain unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:340:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:341:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:342:- The internal separator-colored pixels are placement markers; the single colored tile is the template to stamp into those marked cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:343:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:344:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:345:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:346:  "type": "move_to_match",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:347:  "src": "unique colored sprite tile s in the separator grid",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:348:  "dst": "marked background tile d containing an internal separator-colored marker pixel",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:349:  "match_cond": "every marked d receives the same unique s",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:350:  "transform": "replace d with an exact copy of s, erasing the marker"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:351:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:352:</annotation>
