/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:368:Use the left-edge color legend to draw a padded rectangular halo around each matching object while preserving enclosed holes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:369:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:370:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:371:- The grid has a dominant background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:372:- One or more two-row markers sit on the left edge; each marker is a 2x2 block whose left column is an object color and right column is its halo color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:373:- Away from the markers, every source color from the legend appears as one or more 4-connected monochrome objects.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:374:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:375:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:376:- Keep the input pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:377:- For each source-color object, take its tight bbox expanded by one cell and clipped to the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:378:- Recolor background pixels in that expanded region to the marker's halo color, except for background holes enclosed by the object.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:379:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:380:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:381:- The small left-edge bars are a legend: they map object colors to the colors used for the surrounding padded bbox.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:382:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:383:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:384:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:385:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:386:  "src": "4-connected monochrome objects on the background plus left-edge two-column color legend markers",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:387:  "transform": "for each object whose color appears in the legend, fill background pixels in its one-cell padded bbox with the paired legend color; preserve the object and any enclosed background holes",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:388:  "symbol_instructions": "left-edge two-column legend maps object color to bbox-fill color"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:389:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/1.md:390:</annotation>
