/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:89:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:90:- The dominant background color forms one solid separator row and one solid
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:91:  separator column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:92:- The separator cross splits the grid into four equal rectangular corner regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:93:- Each corner region contains exactly one background-colored blank pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:94:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:95:Rule:
