/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:97:- The completed region multiset is defined by the maximum observed count of
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:98:  each color across the four regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:99:- Replace each region's blank pixel with the single color needed to match that
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:100:  completed multiset.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:101:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:102:Key insight:
