/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:128:Recolor the row-wise passage indicated by wall pixels with the singleton marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:129:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:130:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:131:- A dominant background contains one singleton marker pixel and one wall color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:132:- Wall pixels lie on several rows and form left/right limits around the marker column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:133:- Empty rows between the top and bottom wall rows are open horizontal passages.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:134:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:135:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:136:- On a wall row, paint background pixels between the nearest wall strictly
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:137:  left of the marker column and the nearest wall at or right of it; if only
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:138:  one side is present, paint from that wall to the opposite grid edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:139:- On empty rows between the top and bottom wall rows, paint the whole row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:140:- On empty rows outside the wall-row band, reuse the nearest end wall-row interval.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:141:- Preserve wall pixels and the original marker pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:142:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:143:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:144:- The wall color defines scanline limits relative to the marker column; the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:145:  marker color fills those implied horizontal spans rather than flood-filling
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:146:  through connected background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:147:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:148:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:149:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:150:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:151:  "src": "one singleton marker pixel and rows of wall-color pixels on a dominant background",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:152:  "transform": "recolor background pixels in the scanline passage selected by the marker column: wall rows fill between nearest wall limits, empty interior rows fill full width, and empty exterior rows reuse the nearest end interval"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:153:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:154:</annotation>
