/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:170:Fill enclosed regions along a line seeded by unique border pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:171:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:172:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:173:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:174:- Colored lines/drawings on the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:175:- Unique single-pixel colors on the grid border mark seed endpoints of each line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:176:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:177:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:178:- Each border seed pixel connects (8-connected) to a line drawing.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:179:- Find closed bg cavities whose boundary touches that line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:180:- Flood-fill each such cavity with the seed pixel's color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:181:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:182:Key insight: Only cavities reachable through the seed's own line get filled; the seed's unique color acts as a per-line fill label.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:183:</description>
