/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:220:Reveal the rectangular patch hidden by the solid marker using the grid's reflection symmetries.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:221:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:222:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:223:- A square colored pattern with one solid rectangular marker color occluding a patch.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:224:- The visible pattern has horizontal and vertical reflection symmetry on a large lower/right strip.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:225:- The top and left outer strips also expose transpose counterparts for cells not recoverable by those reflections.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:226:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:227:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:228:- Find the unique color whose full extent is a solid rectangle; this rectangle is the output region.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:229:- Infer the reflected strip start as the smallest row/column offset whose lower/right strips are mirror-consistent, ignoring marker pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:230:- For each marker pixel, copy the unique non-marker value in its horizontal/vertical reflection orbit; if that orbit is entirely hidden in the outer strip, use the transposed top/left-strip counterpart.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:231:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:232:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:233:The marker is not part of the pattern; it covers a missing rectangle whose cells are still determined by the visible mirror or transpose copies elsewhere in the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:234:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:235:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:236:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:237:  "type": "symmetry/pattern",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:238:  "src": "solid rectangular marker over a mirrored color pattern",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:239:  "dst": "hidden marker-sized rectangle",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:240:  "transform": "replace each marker pixel by the matching pixel from its horizontal/vertical reflection orbit; use the transposed top/left-strip counterpart when that orbit is also hidden",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:241:  "grid_shape": "crop to marker bbox"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:242:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:243:</annotation>
