/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:259:Count same-color patterns per frame and represent the tally as dots inside.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:260:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:261:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:262:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:263:- Hollow rectangular frames in various colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:264:- Small monochrome pattern sprites scattered outside frames.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:265:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:266:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:267:- Remove all small patterns from the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:268:- For each frame of color C, count how many patterns share color C.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:269:- Draw that many dots along the frame's center row, spaced by 2, starting from the right.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:270:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:271:Key insight: Frames act as tally displays — scattered same-color patterns are "absorbed" and their count is shown as interior dots.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed454434671/2/codegen_prompts/4.md:272:</description>
